{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-08-29 09:00:00', 'title': 'SAINT ELIZABETH UNIVERSITY RECEIVES GRANT TO SUPPORT HISPANIC STUDENTS PURSUING HEALTHCARE CAREERS', 'text': 'PROGRESANDO INITIATIVE PROMOTES THE ECONOMIC AND SOCIAL MOBILITY OF HISPANIC ADULTS MORRISTOWN, N.J. , AUG. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SAINT ELIZABETH UNIVERSITY (SEU) WAS AWARDED A TWO-YEAR $200,000 GRANT FROM BANK OF AMERICA TO SUPPORT HISPANIC-LATINO STUDENTS PURSUING CAREERS IN HEALTHCARE THROUGH ITS PROGRESANDO INITIATIVE.'}